                        "source_sense_id": "208220ab-2c28-35ff-905d-76abcbf77774",
                        "source_sense_description": "Botanik: das Organ der Blüte, das die Samenanlagen trägt",
                        "target_lang_word": "carpel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carpel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09d75fb0-94e9-36b1-bbf6-e5ce1cf28b1c",
                                        "entry_id": "f48174ec-885d-393b-8cf2-8c9542e2a19f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A constituent part of a flower pistil: the female reproductive organs in a flower. A carpel is composed of an ovary, a style, and a stigma, although some flowers have carpels without a distinct style. In origin, carpels are leaves (megasporophylls) that have evolved to enclose the ovules. A pistil may be composed of a single carpel or of several carpels fused together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "975ccaae-8d47-4f9d-a52e-16f113ffcd47",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1bcf01b-bd8e-3adc-855d-437f8ff6c2e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "208220ab-2c28-35ff-905d-76abcbf77774",
                        "source_sense_description": "Botanik: das Organ der Blüte, das die Samenanlagen trägt",
                        "target_lang_word": "carpelle",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carpelle",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d500fd7-e129-3057-8015-490eec8db5c6",
                                        "entry_id": "a451d93c-ec4e-3eeb-83e6-b2946e8e917b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Organe floral femelle constituant l’unité du gynécée, généralement formé d’un ovaire, d’un style et d’un stigmate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Anatomie végétale"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "218263a2-88b4-4e86-8a04-a74d6151dc43",
                                                "sense_id": "1d500fd7-e129-3057-8015-490eec8db5c6",
                                                "text": "Les étamines, très allongées, sont au nombre de quatre, tout comme les carpelles qui forment au centre le pistil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a51e7bd2-7577-4938-8515-0d2d1cf71647",
                                                "sense_id": "1d500fd7-e129-3057-8015-490eec8db5c6",
                                                "text": "Dès que commence à mûrir la graine, la tige s’incurve, semble fléchir sous le poids des carpelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1668a2e7-2e85-4692-a716-cd10d4018824",
                                                "sense_id": "1d500fd7-e129-3057-8015-490eec8db5c6",
                                                "text": "Ce poids témoigne de la densité de la pulpe contenue dans les carpelles, ses enveloppes que nous appelons quartiers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
